    keyPoints: ["Specificity vs Context Completeness", "Boundary Loss Prevention"],
    idealAnswerEn: "Chunk Size too small: loses surrounding semantic context. Chunk Size too large: dilutes vector specificity and floods the LLM context. Chunk Overlap (e.g. 10\u201320%) prevents losing critical sentences split right across arbitrary boundary cuts.",
